Given a budget of $100 for food and supplies for a hiking trip, and a plan to make sandwiches with at least one of each ingredient in each sandwich, how many sandwiches can be made while ensuring the same number of turkey and ham sandwiches and the same number of cheese and lettuce sandwiches? What will be the maximum budget left for snacks if a pickle is added to each sandwich? If $20 is saved for souvenirs, how many sandwiches can be made with the remaining budget? Assuming a total of 20 sandwiches, what is the cost per sandwich, accounting for the cost of bread and condiments? Please provide a Python code to solve this problem.
    
